  "label": {
    "en": [
      "This is a vintage postcard displaying a blank, sepia-toned address side. It features Spanish-language text with the heading 'TARJETA POSTAL' and 'UNION POSTAL UNIVERSAL,' followed by a handwritten address. There's a designated square for a stamp in the upper left corner and fine, elegant calligraphy for the recipient's address. The design suggests it is from the early 20th century."
    ]
